    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- Open index.html to view the sample decision wheel and its plan.\r\n- Read the 'Desired Plan for the Wheel' carefully.\r\n- Observe the initial state of the 'AI-Generated Wheel'.\r\n- Use the 'Prompt Dial' controls to change the wheel's appearance and functionality.\r\n- Compare the modified wheel with the details in the plan.\r\n- Identify which aspects match and which do not after using the controls.\r\n- Think about whether you would 'Keep', 'Redirect' with a new prompt, or 'Edit' a small part yourself.",
